# A list of an open element type keeps its base reads unfolded, so a
# store's place is rooted at a read of the local. The store reads the
# local again after its `IsUnique`, and the base read holds no count
# across that check: alone it goes, and beside an element read it is a
# borrow that ends before the check. A count there would make the check
# copy the whole buffer at every store.
